          "type": "content",
          "supline": "Our Guest House",
          "headline": "The Farmhouse",
          "content": "_Come back to yourself, nestled in nature._\n\nSix lovingly designed rooms, each with a private bathroom, floor-to-ceiling windows and a terrace with a view worth waking up for. Guests share an open kitchen and a cosy living room with fireplace, plus a guest WC — heated by solar-thermal and the fire, and powered by 18 solar panels with battery storage and a backup generator. High-speed Wi-Fi throughout, via Starlink.\n\n- 6 rooms, each with a private bathroom\n- Solar-thermal heating & fireplace\n- 18 solar panels + battery, with backup generator\n- High-speed Wi-Fi via Starlink",
