        {
          "type": "content",
          "supline": "Round & Grounded",
          "headline": "The Yurts",
          "content": "_Reconnect with yourself, surrounded by forest and birdsong._\n\nTwo to three single yurts and one double yurt, hand-built and tucked into the trees. Singles have a double bed and their own deck — pure nature, some with a fireplace or freestanding gas heater and an outdoor kitchen. The double yurt sleeps more, with two double beds, a couch, a kitchen, fireplace and pellet heating, plus Starlink internet. All yurts share access to a co-working space with the community, also on Starlink.\n\n- 2–3 single yurts, plus 1 double yurt\n- Cold water; some with hot water & outdoor shower\n- Outdoor compost toilet; some with fireplace or gas heater\n- Shared co-working space with Starlink internet",
          "settings": {
            "textCenter": false,
            "listIcons": "houses,shower,flame,wifi"
          },
          "buttons": []
        },
