        {
          "type": "content",
          "supline": "The New Luxury",
          "headline": "Glamping Tents",
          "content": "_Your temple in the forest, with the birds._\n\nThree 4-season tents, insulated and fitted with diesel heating for winter comfort — our other glamping tents run seasonally, available April through October. Every tent has a kingsize bed with a feather duvet and a carpeted floor. Guests share an outdoor kitchen, showers, toilets and a co-working space with the community, all on Starlink internet.\n\n- 3 four-season tents with diesel heating (winter)\n- Other tents available April – October\n- Kingsize bed, feather duvet & carpet\n- Shared kitchen, showers, WCs & co-working, Starlink",
