          "supline": "Bring Your Own",
          "headline": "Camper Vans & Vans",
          "content": "_Wake up surrounded by nature, birdsong, and wide open skies._\n\nA peaceful place to slow down, recharge, and enjoy the simple beauty of countryside living — whether you stay a few nights or longer. We keep a small number of carefully placed spots to keep the atmosphere calm and spacious. Guests share access to the outdoor kitchen, showers, toilets and a co-working space with the community, all on Starlink internet.\n\n- A few carefully placed spots, kept calm & spacious\n- Shared kitchen, showers, WCs & co-working, Starlink",
